/// Bead `sts2-rs-wvpjv` (d): the GoldAxe upgrade adds Retain only
/// (`OnUpgrade` in `GoldAxe.cs`), so an upgraded GoldAxe deals the SAME
/// damage as the base card for an identical play count.
